title: The Youth League
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and c_youth_timer <= 0
on-arrival: c_youth_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
frequency: 200
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= The Youth League

[? if year <= 1920 : The Free Socialist Youth ?][? if year >= 1921 : The Communist Youth League ?] has thousands of members: apprentices, young workers, boys who missed the trenches by a year or two and girls who ran the machines while their fathers were at the front. They are the most radical people in the movement, and they know it.

Their leaders want to run their own affairs, as Willi Münzenberg's Youth International always has. The Zentrale is not so sure.

- @autonomy: Let the youth run their own affairs.
- @discipline: Put the league under the Zentrale.
- @apprentices: Send them into the workshops and the unions.
- @easy_discard

@autonomy
subtitle: The youth are fiery and grateful. The Left is pleased.
on-arrival: {!
Q.militancy += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
Q.red_guards_strength += 0.3;
Q.unity -= 2;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

The league holds its own congress, elects its own leaders and publishes its own paper, which is rude about everybody, including us.

@discipline
subtitle: The league follows the party line. Some of the young ones walk away.
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 3;
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 4;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 4;
Q.militancy -= 2;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.99;
}
Q['lean_' + Q.leading_faction] += 1;
!}

A member of the Zentrale now sits on the league's executive, and every leaflet goes through the party office first.

@apprentices
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow work for apprentices' pay and rights. The Right approves.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Young communists join the metalworkers' youth sections and fight for the eight-hour day for apprentices. It is less exciting than the barricades, and it lasts longer.
